# AGENTS.md — __NAME__

A static site built with [Winged-Python](https://github.com/micheltlutz/Winged-Python).

## Commands

| Task | Command |
| --- | --- |
| Build the site | `winged build` |
| Preview it | `winged serve --watch` |
| Check accessibility | `winged build --check-a11y` |

## Layout

- `site.py` — the generator. Every page is a function returning a `Document`.
- `layout.py` — the shared shell. It satisfies `winged.Layout` by defining `render`.
- `assets/` — copied into `dist/` verbatim.
- `dist/` — generated. Never edit it, never commit it.

## Rules

1. Text content is escaped. Pass a plain `str`; reach for `RawHtml` only for markup you
   produced yourself, and never for anything that came from data.
2. Paths resolve from `ROOT`, not the current directory.
3. Void elements (`Br`, `Img`, `Input`, …) take no children.
4. `Img` requires `alt` and `Iframe` requires `title`. That is deliberate.
5. Run `winged build` before saying a change is done.
